  ('agent_tool:check_owner_connections', 'Real owner personal/productivity connection status', 'Real owner_sources rows -- Gmail, Google Calendar, Google Drive, Notion, GitHub, voice notes, desktop companion, chat platform imports. Different scope from check_connections (customer-facing Google Business/Search Console/GA4/Vercel/WhatsApp/social) -- section 9''s Connections requirement names GitHub and Notion explicitly, neither covered elsewhere. Live-verified against production: 10 real rows for the real owner (github/notion/google_drive/desktop_companion/stratxcel_internal/stratxcel_admin_ui/voice_notes CONNECTED; google_calendar/gmail genuinely ERROR; chat_platforms UNAVAILABLE) -- exactly the honest mixed-status data this tool exists to surface, not fabricated as all-green.', 'ecosystem', 'owner connections read', 'check_owner_connections', 'lib/agent-core/owner-connections-tool.ts (owner_sources table)', 'Engineering', 'gmail,google_calendar,google_drive,notion,github', 'agent:read:integrations', 'read', 'platform_only', 'free', 'read', 'none (read-only; deliberately does not call listSources()/ensureSourceRows(), which upserts rows as a side effect -- queries the table directly to stay genuinely read-only)', 'REAL_EXPOSED', null, null, now(), 'claude_session_2026-09-02');
